# The PAPER setting, set to Letter in the setup menu ([A]) as a user does it, gives
# Letter pages: our ESC/P pages (PRFILES, as in pages-escp) become three
# 8.5 x 11 inch pages, the pixels the host test draws on Letter
# (tools/printer/golden/TEXT.PRN.letter.pages and GRAPH.PRN.letter.pages),
# and the PDF is the one tools/printer/render --letter writes for the same
# bytes (make_bench_disks.sh's escp-expected-letter.pdf).
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
text "Machine +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key a
text "P\[a\]per +: Letter" 300
text "Machine +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 300
key e
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
key 0x39
log "pages: job 00000001 page 1 2040x2376 MD5 afeab6ba98461a13ff9c9bcb6da47b52" 3000
log "pages: job 00000001 page 2 2040x2376 MD5 e26ac2c2a1ea7753e3bfb427c3309454" 600
log "pages: job 00000001 page 3 2040x2376 MD5 d998a0c9b47c1c2348d3cbcf9ed0ac91" 600
log "pages: job 00000001 rendered, 3 pages, PDF 31764 bytes" 600
cardsame PRINTER/00000001.pdf tools/dev/builds/disks/escp-expected-letter.pdf
